        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2001-03-14/pdf/01-6558.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (‘‘Board’’). There is established,\neffective March 12, 2001, a Board of three members to be appointed by\nthe President to investigate this dispute. No member shall be pecuniarily\nor otherwise interested in any organization of airline employees or any\nair carrier. The Board shall perform its functions subject to the availability\nof funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2006,
      "char_start": 1890,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13205#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13205#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "66 FR 15011, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "e67d9e91a310c282589b8ac81200ea54be892c6df169a0446206e4c8864cbc67",
        "signing_date": "2001-03-09",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13205.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7f8d00002163444749e95b1786d6549158d38393cbdd4ce0bb5a4f78ddfb2659",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2001-03-14/pdf/01-6558.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to\nthis dispute within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2338,
      "char_start": 2007,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13205#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
